## 8. Verification Results

Script: `scripts/verify_step2.py`

All 12 items passed: syntax check, old code removal, CPU probe loop, enabled=False zero records,
task boundary isolation, task_id auto-increment, unregistered probe warning, CSV correctness, auto CSV write,
TaskLifecycle interface, summary format (including total sum row), invalid backend error.

